WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:35.250
Don't load missiles
onto my Valkyrie.

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:37.480
You were only able to
save them by firing.

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:40.110
Look, a professional's job
isn't just self-satisfaction...

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:41.560
Sorry, but we can't.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:42.300
Basara !

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:44.910
It's nothing that
concerns you.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:46.770
It does too.

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:49.310
You can't try to be
rational with him.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:50.700
Bomber.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:56.880
It wasn't you, but the Unified
Forces who beat off the enemy !

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:26.050
194th place !
What good's that ?!

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:28.910
We finally made our debut,
and we're not selling any records.

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:50.150
Hey, everyone,
don't you get it ?!

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:53.580
Huh ? What's wrong ?

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:56.210
We're #194...#194 !

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:57.760
Last week, we were #195 !

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:00.360
The week before, when the
single first came out, we were #196.

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.800
Well, it's only been 3 weeks
since it came out...

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.320
What do you expect ?

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:06.870
What's wrong with that ?
As long as we're moving up.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.910
What kind of slacker
attitude is that ?!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:12.080
At this rate, how many years do you
think it'll take to make it to the top 10 ?

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.910
They'll have forgotten
about us by then !

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.320
When they sell, they'll sell.

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:18.020
What's that ?!

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:20.670
There's no point in recording
with an attitude like that.

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:24.200
Unless you record knowing you've got a hit,
you can't be considered a professional singer.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:28.170
If you have a naive attitude like that, you'll be
stuck living a "mayonnaise rice" kind of life.

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:29.710
What's wrong with you ?

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:31.650
Have you even tried
mayonnaise rice before ?

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:34.960
Well, no.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:38.470
But I'm telling you, you have to take
the recording seriously, like a pro.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:39.910
Okay, I hear you.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.500
Fine, let's start
practicing the new song.

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:46.360
Give it your all, okay ?

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.310
In this second song,
Mylene has the main vocal.

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:50.510
Right...

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:52.360
All right !

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:53.910
Let's go !

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:07.610
I've gotta make
this song a big hit !

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.360
Bathe me in...

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:23.430
ANGEL NIGHT

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.760
Hey, hey ! Don't play
this kind of song !

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.590
It'll ruin our reputation.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.590
But it's a
pretty good song.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:42.460
No, it isn't.

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:46.740
Why "Akiko Lipps" would produce something
like this, I'll never know. It won't sell.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:50.440
This is the way to go...
Alice Holiday.

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:52.210
But that last song
was pretty good too.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:54.390
Don't give me any more lip,
or you're fired.

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:55.390
Excuse me.

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:00.560
Right ! Thank you very
much for your patronage !

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:17.240
This is bad !

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:27.040
...walking towards
rainbow-colored stars up above.

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:29.880
Chas...

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.760
Sorry...I messed up again.

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:39.090
What the hell are you doing over there ?
That's the important part !

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:41.310
If you don't give it your all here,
just when are you going to ?

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:42.500
All right already !

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:45.390
This is an important part,
so I wanted to be sure to do it right.

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:48.540
I'm thinking hard
about singing my best !

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.920
Thinking about it doesn't do us any good.
It's not going to happen if you don't sing.

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:54.330
I told you I want
to do this right !

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:58.190
Worrying about useless things like "doing it
right" or "doing it well" hurts your singing !

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.820
Just sing with all your heart,
and give it your all !

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:04.060
What's wrong with my way ?
I have my way, you have yours.

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:06.700
If we do it your way,
we'll never finish.

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:11.170
Is that so.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:12.120
I understand.

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:14.950
Hey, Mylene !

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:21.060
Ray, although it was only a short
while, it was nice knowing you.

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:22.850
Hey, Mylene !

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:26.800
Basara !

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:30.860
I was trying to encourage her...
maybe she didn't get it ?

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.440
Hey...

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:35.480
Do you know how many members
have quit on us now ?

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:37.190
Hurry up and
get her back !

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:38.280
Alright already !

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:08.310
Are you sure she
came this way ?

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:09.710
Yeah, I'm sure.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:13.020
Hey, did Alice Holiday...

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:20.390
Did you see a young lady who
sorta looks like Alice Holiday ?

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.060
No...

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.560
Oh, okay.
Thanks anyway.

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:45.990
Thanks for helping me out.

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:47.830
Not at all.

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:50.560
Actually, I'm sorry for
just blurting out "no."

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:53.160
I never thought
I'd meet you, Alice.

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:57.110
But, is this all right ?

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:01.190
Is work going okay ?

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:02.870
It doesn't matter.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.620
I can't sing that
well any more anyway.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.220
Oh, sorry !

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:10.060
What do you mean,
you can't sing well any more ?

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:11.340
It's over.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.890
I know that better
than anyone else.

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:16.180
That's not
true at all.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:24.640
Sample GLQ's Spiritia level 45.

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:26.040
Continuing with investigation.

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:30.440
It's because I wanted to be a singer
like you that I joined a rock band.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.990
I love the way you sing.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:36.290
Even in the quiet songs, the burning in
your heart comes through so well....

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:38.970
...you'd burn yourself
if you were to touch it.

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:41.470
How do you sing that way ?

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:44.030
I never even thought about it.

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:47.780
If I knew that, maybe I'd
be able to sing well again.

00:08:47.780 --> 00:08:48.940
Alice...

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:53.920
You see, I'm like a canary
who forgot how to sing.

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:55.930
It's best to
just toss me out.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:08.600
That sports car sounds
like our Mylene's...

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:10.800
Do you know which way
she might've gone ?

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.330
Please, tell us !

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:17.440
If we don't find her soon, her
concert tomorrow will be a disaster !

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:21.270
Well, we're in a bind too,
now that Mylene is gone.

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:24.640
Are you telling me Mylene
took off with this Alice person ?

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:26.970
Well, it sorta
looks that way.

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:30.250
What're we gonna do ?

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.440
Alice hasn't returned even though
it's already time for her rehearsal !

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.750
She's never pulled a
stunt like this before !

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:42.460
Isn't that...

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:46.140
Michael, we've spotted
Miss Mylene's car on AZ street.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.140
What ?

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:49.130
Wasn't she supposed
to be in Akusho ?

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:51.230
Well, yes, but...

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:54.030
Presently, we're
following on CC Avenue.

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:56.990
Good. Continue following her.
I'm going to head that way too.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:57.860
Understood.

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:02.590
Sorry, but I'm going to drive
a little more aggressively !

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.850
Mom's goons are always
following me around !

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:13.840
We're going to hit him !

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:18.170
What happened ?

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:20.240
Sorry, we lost them.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:21.280
What ?

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:24.360
She's probably
headed to RC street.

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:27.390
Find her. We're not going to
give up just because we lost her.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:31.130
If she's still wandering around at this hour,
how will we explain it to Mayor Miria ?

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:32.540
R...right.

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:40.000
They've got
to be kidding !

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:44.900
It ticks me off how they're always
trying to keep me on a tight leash.

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:49.040
And that guy, blabbing on without even
considering other people's feelings.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.650
That ticks me off.

00:10:54.810 --> 00:10:58.610
And he doesn't sing
with all his heart.

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:01.810
Is that how things
are going for you ?

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:06.130
How nice...
Those are wonderful troubles.

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:07.490
I'm jealous...

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:08.490
Alice...

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:12.990
Now sampling GLQ's Spiritia.

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:21.090
Spiritia level lowered to 12.
Data collection complete.

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:24.680
That's right !

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:28.310
My troubles are still childish...
I really think so.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.030
Which way should we go ?

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:31.760
Alice ?

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:34.950
Alice ?
Have you fallen asleep ?

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:48.800
Lord Gepelnitch, we've
received scout 23's report:

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:53.500
"Sample GLQ's Spiritia level is now 12.
Data collection complete."

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:56.040
"We are now
in recovery mode."

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.620
Very well.

00:11:57.620 --> 00:12:01.540
Lord Gepelnitch, why are we
repeating this experiment ?

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:05.000
We have a nearly complete reading
of that fleet's Spiritia level.

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:07.410
Now we should launch an all-out attack.

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:10.590
Have you forgotten
the tale in the dream ?

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:13.680
Whether that clan is well
suited to my dream or not.

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:15.560
That is what
I am investigating.

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:18.140
"Dream" ?

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:20.290
Don't you understand ?

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.420
Alice, please cheer up !

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:35.090
There will be times when you
can't sing even if you want to.

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:40.680
It may not be my place to say this,
but you can't just throw it all away.

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:46.550
Because I wanted to sing, and I wanted
others to listen to me sing, I became a singer.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:48.980
I can't quit now.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:55.630
I was really motivated by your words when
you said my troubles are a bit childish.

00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:59.660
Did I wake you ?

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:01.940
I got all worked up there.

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:05.730
For some reason, I feel like
I don't care about anything any more.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:09.710
Hey...just a sec !
Alice ! Hello ?!

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:11.990
It's such a bother...

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:14.820
Alice ?!  But...

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:24.300
Nobody's picking up.
Maybe she's gone back to the mansion.

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:27.240
There aren't too many
other places to look.

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:29.080
We'll have to go
to her mom's place.

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:31.250
No way !
Then what about Alice ?

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.840
Well, what should we do ?

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:34.450
Maybe go back...

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:36.760
...to our place.

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:39.380
Uh, why ?

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:42.140
She's not like
everyone else.

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:45.690
I guess not.
Then, let's go back.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.500
That was Fire Bomber's van !

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:57.880
Follow them !
We may be able to find her !

00:13:58.450 --> 00:13:59.640
Y...yes, sir !

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:06.070
Rain ?

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:20.280
Why did they turn the rain
on in the middle of the night ?

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:21.530
Are you all right ?

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:23.460
I'll find some
shelter soon.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:30.790
With this kind of rain, it'll
be tough getting back to Akusho.

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:34.430
She says left.

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:35.340
Okay.

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:36.100
What's up ?

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.050
It seems like Veffidas
has found Mylene.

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:39.160
Really ?

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.290
Veffidas is good at
this sort of thing.

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.080
Then you really
found them, right ?

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:45.710
Thanks ! We owe
you our lives !

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:48.930
Shut up, will ya ?
All we said was that we found Mylene.

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:55.090
There are some stairs ahead.
Be careful.

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:55.830
Right.

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:58.330
The brake !

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:06.140
Are you okay,
all wet and all ?

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:07.900
Don't worry about it.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:10.660
Alice ?

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.990
So, I ended
up here again.

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:24.950
What ? Did you use
to live in Akusho?

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.260
Akusho ?
Why do you ask ?

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:29.000
Well...

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:31.950
Once again, I'm living the
"mayonnaise rice" life.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:34.290
Alice...

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:37.140
Well, what difference
does it make ?

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:38.950
Alice !

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:41.290
Standing is
such a chore.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:42.810
Please cheer up.

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:44.710
Please let us
hear you sing again.

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.560
Me, sing ?

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:47.970
Right.

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:49.820
I don't feel like
singing any more.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:51.140
What are you saying ?

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:53.760
If you stop singing...

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.850
If you stop singing,
won't it be sad ?

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:00.240
Spiritia level 12...no change.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:06.340
It was because I admired you so much
that I joined a rock band. It's true...

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:08.480
So, now I'll sing
with all my heart.

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:13.780
Bathe me in stardust. Mm...baby.

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:21.430
It's a fantasy that
swirls round in the sky.

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:27.760
Creating a rainbow in the night.
Mm...Baby, yeah.

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:29.470
Spiritia level changing. Acting strangely.

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:36.790
We begin walking towards
a rainbow-colored stars up above.

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.670
Basara, Veffidas ?

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:43.540
What's wrong, Mylene ?
Keep going.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:44.640
O...okay.

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:52.740
...till the night gives
way to dawn.(Fly fly fly.)

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:58.990
You and me,
both free as the wind...

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:04.690
...play out our cosmic melody.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:07.180
Spiritia level 20...25...

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:10.380
It's returning to
previous levels...31.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.280
Oh, Alice !

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:24.540
A heartbeat turns into a comet.
Mm...Maybe.

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:32.100
It's our mysterious paradise
that is falling away.

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:38.890
Slipping away, the peace of sleep.
Mm...Maybe, yeah.

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:40.540
50...52...55.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.090
Slowly we both awaken
and the words begin to flow.
50...52...55.

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:44.540
Confirmed. Sample GLQ's Spiritia is recovering.
Slowly we both awaken
and the words begin to flow.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:47.900
Subject is definitely capable
of Spiritia rejuvenation.
Slowly we both awaken
and the words begin to flow.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:48.170
Slowly we both awaken
and the words begin to flow.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:56.240
An orange colored flower
floating high above the clouds.

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:57.200
Can you hear it ?
An orange colored flower
floating high above the clouds.

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:57.740
It's Miss Mylene singing.
An orange colored flower
floating high above the clouds.

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:58.700
Dancing its trembling dance.
It's Miss Mylene singing.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:01.030
Dancing its trembling dance.

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:09.730
Floating rainbow-colored
in the dead of night.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:10.640
What ?!

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:17.620
Spiritia level 60.

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:22.000
Completely recovered.  Will apprehend and return with Sample GLQ.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:23.990
Ray, I'm leaving
the rest up to you !

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:24.890
Basara !

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:26.590
Mylene, I'm going
to borrow your car !

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:34.240
Quick, into the van !

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:36.540
Hurry !

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:48.820
That was her car !

